  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.4.2 — Performance follow-up. Diffed selection-toggle: single-row select/deselect now updates only the affected row's DOM instead of walking every visible <tr>. Column-resize drag rAF-throttled and pre-resolves matching body cells once per drag — eliminates 100+ querySelector calls per pointermove. New `performanceMarks: true` option emits User Timing API entries (boostgrid:<id>:header|body|footer) so app authors can profile renders in Chrome DevTools. Builds on 2.4.1's stability + perf foundation; drop-in patch.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Bootstrap 5 data grid (vanilla JS, TypeScript, less than 15 KB gzipped).",
